  "description": "For as long as Heeji could remember, Woohak was nothing more than a reliable best friend. That safe, platonic dynamic shatters overnight when he unexpectedly sends her an explicit photo of himself. Before she can even process the shock, Heeji finds herself face-to-face with Woohak as he boldly exposes himself right in front of her. Teasingly asking if she came to make a purchase, he leaves her completely mesmerized and utterly unable to look away. Leaning in with a seductive proposition, Woohak makes it clear that this exclusive offer is currently free of charge. Will Heeji really be able to pass up a limited time deal this tempting?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
